# Only the paths below need the owner's approval. Branch protection on master
# has "Require review from Code Owners" enabled with 0 required general
# approvals, so a PR touching only unlisted paths can be merged by its author,
# while a PR touching any path below cannot merge until a member of the `owners`
# team approves it. The team needs Write access to the repo or GitHub ignores it.
# Do not add a catch-all `*` rule: it would make every PR owner-gated again.
/.github/               @mitch-pro/owners
/tools/deploy.sh        @mitch-pro/owners
/AGENTS.md              @mitch-pro/owners
/rust/crates/mitch-lib/src/auth.rs @mitch-pro/owners
